********************************************************************************
* Process:      L110AE IO device
* Device Type:  N- and P-FET
* Description:  3.3V MOS Transistor
* Model:        BSIM3 3.24 (HSPICE Level=49)
* Simulator:    HSPICE
* Model Version:0.2_p1
* Model features:
*     Global model:  Yes
*     Igate model:  No
*     GIDL model: No
*     Substrate Current model: Yes
*     Flicker Noise: Yes
*     LOD model: Yes
*     RF model: No
*     Well proximity effect: No
********************************************************************************
* <Revision 1>
* Version : 0.2p1
* Date    : 2011/07/14
* Owner   : Shih-hsin Yeh
* Comment : Original release.
********************************************************************************
* Application ranges:
* Geometry range(After 90% shrink):
*
* For both Vcc=3.3 V n-ch and p-ch MOSFET:
* 0.324 um <= LDES <= 50 um
* 0.35 um <= WDES <= 100 um
*
* Adopt multi-finger structures if WDES > 9 um.
* 0.324um <=SA,SB<= 1.98um
*
* Note: SAREF=SBREF=1.98um is the reference dimension of the STI-stress (LOD) effect.
*
* Voltage range:
* For n-ch MOSFET:
* 0V <= VGS <= Vcc (*1.1)
* 0V <= VDS <= Vcc (*1.1)
* -Vcc <= VBS <= 0V
* For p-ch MOSFET:
* 0V >= VGS >= -Vcc (*1.1)
* 0V >= VDS >= -Vcc (*1.1)
* Vcc >= VBS >= 0V
*
* Temperature range: -50c ~ 125c ; nominal temperature=25c
***************************** Start of Model Card ******************************
.option gmindc=1e-13
**
